      "role": "user",
      "content": "wow that's actually really good. it hits all the right notes. i was worried it would sound too biased but the way u phrased it makes it sound like a factual inevitability. can u add a bit more about how it basically makes certain states irrelevant and just focuses everything on a few swing states? like, make it sound like the system is fundamentally broken for most Americans.",
